<title>SINGAPORE: Asia Pulp &amp; Paper Co Ltd Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Asia Pulp &amp; Paper Co Ltd Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> ADS			  $0.33		    $0.17</p>
<p> Net			 65,529		   34,473</p>
<p> Revs		     427,463		  388,527</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Results shown in Indonesian accounting standards.</p>
<p>Under U.S. accounting standards, Q1 net income would have been $44 million, or $0.22 a share.</p>
</text>
